\\builtin\any;
# builtin/any.src - implementation of the built-in Any type (std::any, RTTI-backed top type).
# Loaded explicitly by the umbrella `\std();` (or `\\builtin\any();`). Required whenever Any is
# MATERIALIZED (a value/parameter/field actually has type Any); the compiler-internal inference
# sentinel is `Auto` (Group::kAuto) and never requires this module.
@[include("any")@]
Any = %std::any { };
